06:06.090 --> 06:09.060
I'm not that crazy, but in my experience,

06:09.060 --> 06:11.280
I just use git stash and git stash pop.

06:11.280 --> 06:13.110
Put one thing in there and remove it.

06:13.110 --> 06:16.080
Anyway, we can view all those stashes that we have,

06:16.080 --> 06:17.370
